                    "title": "Gentle, Effective, and Reliable Relief at a Great Value",
                    "url": "https://amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/REBNXU7OASIYY/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8",
                    "review_text": "Gentle, Effective, and Reliable Relief at a Great Value Kirkland Signature’s Stool Softener has become my dependable choice for maintaining regularity without harsh side effects. Each softgel contains 100 mg of docusate sodium — the same active ingredient as Colace — but at a fraction of the cost. The 400-count bottle is an excellent value and lasts for months, even with daily use. What I like most is how gentle this formula is. It doesn’t cause cramping or urgency — just a smooth, predictable result when taken consistently with adequate hydration. The softgels are small, easy to swallow, and completely tasteless. I’ve found it works especially well post-surgery or when taking medications that can cause constipation. The product quality is consistent, and I’ve never noticed any melting or capsule sticking, even during warm months. Kirkland’s formulation feels clean and reliable — you know exactly what you’re getting. Bottom line: Kirkland’s Stool Softener provides the same dependable relief as Colace at a fraction of the price. Gentle, effective, and budget-friendly — it’s a must-have staple in any home medicine cabinet.",
                    "publication_date": "2025-10-11 00:00:00 +00:00",
